title: Rosaline
---
Rosaline: Hey, Casey.
Rosaline: Tom's got you on the floor alone again, huh?
    -> Yeah...
    -> I'll take the hours.
Rosaline: You want a drink?
    -> On the clock?
    -> You know I'm not old enough.
Rosaline: Like that's ever stopped anyone else.
Rosaline: Well, anyways. It's slow, right?
    -> It's always slow.
    -> And?
Rosaline: Mind watching the bar for me while I smoke?
    -> There it is...
    -> You'd go smoke either way.
Rosaline: You know me well. Be right back.
<pretend a minigame happens here>
Rosaline: Thanks for your help, Casey.
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>
===
title: Tom
---
Tom: Alright, Casey. I'm finished up here for today.
You: Your meeting is today?
Tom: Sure is. The whole thing is just stupid.
Tom: We can't afford their minimum. Even if we could, where the hell are we supposed to store all of that alcohol?
    -> Maybe we don't need to serve alcohol.
      Tom: Sure we do. Where else is anyone supposed to have a drink around here these days?
      Tom: It's damn near the only reason people still show up here. 
    -> Yeah...
Tom: I've tried looking for other suppliers, but...
Tom: Oh, whatever. Watch the floor, kid. 
Tom: A customer needs something, you give it to 'em. Can't lose any more business.
Tom: Rosaline will lock up after you go.
Tom: Best behavior. Seriously.
    -> Loud and clear.
    -> I get it.
Tom: See you tomorrow.

<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>


